    "bbox": [
      55.29,
      445.09,
      546.42,
      480.16
    ],
    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me by Sections 3 & 4 of the Societies Ordinance (Chapter 123), I, Rishad Bathiudeen,Minister of Industry and Commerce, Resettlement of Protracted Displaced Persons and Co-operative Development, doby this notification.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.09,
      493.09,
      546.37,
      528.16
    ],
    "text": "01. Authorize the purpose for which the Society known as \u201cNATIONAL TOURIST DRIVERS ASSOCIATION\u201dsituated at No. 761/1, Induneesiyan Memorial Hall, Negambo Road, Liyanagemulla, Seeduwa as a purpose towhich the powers and facilities of that Ordinance ought to be extended ; and",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      78.09,
      541.09,
      546.54,
      564.16
    ],
    "text": "02. Limit the application of that Ordinance to aforesaid society by exempting it from the provision of Section 5(4)of that Ordinance.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRoman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
